OL,3,GNEWSADentists issue warnings about
OL,4,Aillegal pop-up events in hotels
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dentist says he is "deeply concerned"
OL,7,Fby illegal dental tourism pop-up
OL,8,Fconsultations in Northern Irish hotels,
OL,9,Fwhich are not properly registered.
OL,11,FPaul Brennan, chair of the Northern
OL,12,FIreland branch of the British Dental
OL,13,FAssociation (BDA), said patients'
OL,14,Fmouths were often examined at these
OL,15,Fevents, which constitutes the "practice
OL,16,Fof dentistry".
OL,18,FThe BDA has warned that when dentistry
OL,19,Foccurs and the hotels and dentists are
OL,20,Fnot registered with their regulators,
OL,21,Fit can amount to "illegal practice".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
